{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPELLCAST is a fusion of card battlers and word games. Construct your deck with runes and bonuses, then play words on a grid to use them in battle. The power of your spells changes based on the words and letters you play, making each turn a delicate balance of wizardry and wordplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow more powerful by optimizing your runes and bonuses, collecting artifacts, and upgrading your tiles. Runes also have multiple upgrades that can enhance or greatly change their effects, for a wide variety of deckbuilding possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through 10 unique scenarios, or play the campaign for a more traditional roguelite experience, while aiming for high scores and ranks. You can earn better scores by playing more efficiently, or get a higher ranking by tackling challenging bounties along the way. See how high you can go!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821120?t=1757014350","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/8d004feb1fba6caf055a1a4fbe184b697e935ef5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757014350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/b7cbadb36d8c1a4739872885ccc5a28c479dc74e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757014350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/b7cbadb36d8c1a4739872885ccc5a28c479dc74e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757014350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4001290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPELLCAST is a fusion of card battlers and word games. Construct your deck with runes and bonuses, then play words on a grid to use them in battle. The power of your spells changes based on the words and letters you play, making each turn a delicate balance of wizardry and wordplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow more powerful by optimizing your runes and bonuses, collecting artifacts, and upgrading your tiles. Runes also have multiple upgrades that can enhance or greatly change their effects, for a wide variety of deckbuilding possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through 10 unique scenarios, or play the campaign for a more traditional roguelite experience, while aiming for high scores and ranks. You can earn better scores by playing more efficiently, or get a higher ranking by tackling challenging bounties along the way. See how high you can go!</p>","developers":["BEDiBUG Concepts"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821120/aa9de404aa1103fa0518e373ea7d0144d0912bd1/header.jpg?t=1757014350","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821120/1075955333/49eac4d7dcc78a2750829d50cafd9f9256f18e2e/1753821809/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754066509","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821120/1075955333/49eac4d7dcc78a2750829d50cafd9f9256f18e2e/1753821809/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754066509","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3821120/1075955333/49eac